	(footprint "ModularLight:ControllerJoint_EdgeBoard"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "a91d0387-6a17-4f9e-b60d-9a35791ead48")
		(at 100 94.75)
		(descr "Controller joint, edge-board side (SPEC V6.2 3.2/3.5, decision 0009). 10 SMD pads on the inward face (F.Cu), 2.54 mm pitch, 1.3 x 2.2 mm. Place the origin at z 5.25 (the controller underside, z 5.0, is the y = +0.25 Dwgs line). Pads span z 3.5..5.7: 1.5 mm of fillet land below the controller underside plus 0.7 mm above it (V6 layout: was 3.5 mm tall, lowered so tracks can pass between the pad tops and LED2). Pad n meets the controller pad n: from the F.Cu side with the wall edge at the bottom, pad 1 is leftmost. Order 1..10: +24V GND +5V_LED LED_RETURN LED_DATA_OUT SPARE CANH CANL SENSE DRIVE. Pasted so reflow pre-tins them.")
